# Ironfront Reborn — environment template.
# COMMIT this file. NEVER commit a real .env (see conventions.md section 1.4).
#
# IRONFRONT_SHARED_SECRET is the HMAC key that signs joinTickets. The master
# server (Dev D) issues tickets with it and the game server (Dev C) verifies
# them with it — both processes must be configured with the SAME value, or every
# CONNECT_REQUEST is rejected with CONNECT_DENIED reason 3.
#
# Generate one with:
#   [Convert]::ToBase64String((1..32 | ForEach-Object { Get-Random -Max 256 }))

IRONFRONT_SHARED_SECRET=
IRONFRONT_DB_PATH=./ironfront.db
IRONFRONT_MASTER_PORT=27000
IRONFRONT_GAMESERVER_UDP_PORT=27015
